# Local build caches (regenerated on demand).
site/.speed-baseline/
site/.copyable-build/
.wrangler/

# The repo holds what builds, tests and deploys the site, plus the scripts that make its content.
# Everything below stays on this computer only: work notes, reports and screenshots, research and
# source material, planning docs, and one-off release scripts.
